  "page/Home": "# Home\n\nA tiny notebook. Click a link to open it beside this one: [[Groceries]], [[Ideas]], [[Trip]].\nShift-click opens it here instead. Tags are links too: #fictty #demo\n\n- Tab nests a line under the one above it\n- Enter on a list item starts the next one\n- [ ] Ctrl-T ticks a task, or makes a line one",
  "page/Groceries": "# Groceries\n\n- [ ] Oat milk\n- [ ] Lemons\n- [x] Coffee beans\n\nBack to [[Home]].",
